 * covers all versions) and the <code>registerColumnType</code> API of the dialects.
 * The column types registered in {@link #registerLargeObjectTypeMappings()} are
 * therefore applied in {@link #columnType(int)}.
 *
 * @author Andre Henn
 * @author terrestris GmbH & co. KG
 */
public class ShogunCoreOracleDialect extends OracleDialect {

